Output demos/tty-mode.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 0.5

Type "cup sprint -p personal"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "cup task 86d2cpzm1 -p personal"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "cup overdue -p personal"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "cup summary -p personal"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Sleep 1s
